    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Length changes the word",
      "content": "Play each pair and listen for the length: *hat* (six) / *hát* (back), *szel* (slices) / *szél* (wind), *irt* (clears) / *írt* (wrote), *kor* (age) / *kór* (illness), *tör* (breaks) / *tőr* (dagger), *hurok* (loop) / *húrok* (strings). *üt* (hits) and *űr* (space) aren't an exact pair, but they put the short *ü* right next to the long *ű*."
    },
